  "bodyHtml": "\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-image-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-title-date no-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Guild of Harwich Artists Next General Meeting Feb 17th</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tecset-date\"><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">January 24, 2024 @ 8:00 am</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">5:00 pm</span></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-light-bg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-content-area\">\n\t\t   \t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>The Guild’s next General Meeting will be <strong>Saturday, February 17th</strong>, 2pm at the Harwich Community Center located at 100 Oak Street, Harwich 20645.  Our featured demonstration artist is Bill Lutz, a well-known local artist who will work in acrylics.  Monthly meetings are free and open to the public.  <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6721\" src=\"/media/archive/6331a09638156191c11a7da455f2c5106b00db4ac2295fc71f85aa50683b1903.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-map-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-area\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-past-event-notice\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-notices\"><ul><li>This event has passed.</li></ul></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-details\">\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Details </h2>\n\t<ul class=\"tribe-events-meta-list\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-meta-item\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-start-date-label tribe-events-meta-label\">Date:</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events